{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026HH6lDZocqC1794439680.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>市場預期美國聯邦儲備局將於下月加息，美元匯價持續上升。</p><p></p><p>反映美元兌六隻主要貨幣的美匯指數，升約百分之0.7，至接近103水平。</p><p></p><p>美元兌日圓升約百分之0.7，至接近160水平，見超過兩個月高位。</p><p></p><p>歐元兌美元跌至1.1水平，跌幅近百分之0.7，見約年半低位。</p><p></p><p>英鎊兌美元跌百分之0.5，至1.32水平，見兩個星期低位。</p><p></p><p>美國日前公布上月通脹數據後，市場預期聯儲局下個月，有近九成機會加息四分之一厘，更開始預期可能加息半厘，刺激美元匯價連日上升。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T00:06:44.576175+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":220,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T23:26:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T11:17:13.629571+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T23:59:52.036413+00:00","content_hash":"28c7a00eafaaca1714528060fad9a4a0a0b3883ea29abc0d611588153a136fdb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T00:06:44.576175+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}